  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_header.webp\" alt=\"Header\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_overview.webp\" alt=\"Overview\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>宏偉體驗 – 天空之境</strong>專為尋求嶄新、超越普通《Minecraft》生存體驗的「天空島」風格挑戰者量身打造。合成配方更加嚴苛，推進進度需兼具策略與創意。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你放置的每一塊方塊、收集的每一份資源都至關重要。生存絕非易事——你需要明智規劃、奮勇戰鬥，並發揮創意以突破瓶頸。挑戰伴隨回報：每達一個里程碑都實至名歸，每次勝利皆堪稱偉大。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">若你已準備好突破極限、在雲端綻放光彩，<em>宏偉體驗 – 天空之境</em>將是你下一場偉大的冒險。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">⚙️ <strong>建議配置：</strong>請分配 <strong>6GB–10GB 記憶體</strong>以確保遊戲流暢。<br>❌ <strong>注意：</strong>本整合包不支援 OptiFine</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_features.webp\" alt=\"Features\"></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>自訂主選單</li>\n<li>500 多款模組</li>\n<li>任務系統用於展示部分整合包內的模組。請注意，任務書僅供展示，並非攻略指南。</li>\n<li>透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensional-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dimensional-Paintings</a> 的地獄繪畫自訂進入下界的方式。</li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/telepastries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TelePastries</a> 的暮色蛋糕自訂進入暮色森林的方式。</li>\n<li>內建 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary-Reimagined</a> 渲染器支援優化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_creators.webp\" alt=\"Content Creators\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLVmZZMl8_N68BulAZdqMDFNQ-TtFx2wF3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ytc/APkrFKZ_FIksEX-BH-n_s8ba9pLlW3iLpKl4rAIG8lK_eg=s176-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\" alt=\"IMAGE_ALT\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_issues.webp\" alt=\"Issues\"></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>歡迎加入 Everlasting Creativity <a href=\"https://discord.gg/EVA2pznvjb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>，並在任一支援頻道提出問題。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_credits.webp\" alt=\"Credits\"></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li>BisectHosting - 插畫製作！</li>\n<li>FTB Team - 感謝允許其模組用於 CurseForge 整合包！</li>\n<li>DexxKnight1 - 授權其任務章節用於任務書</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_server.webp\" alt=\"Need a Server\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmoderngamingworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH-ME-Promo\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Monumental_Experience_In_the_Sky/BH_MEITS_links.webp\" alt=\"Links\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ModernGamingWorld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"ModernGamingWorld 的 Patreon 贊助頁面\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmoderngamingworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"ModernGamingWorld 的 Ko-Fi 贊助頁面\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rPrzCTWJ8w\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"ModernGamingWorld 的 Discord 社群\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/moderngamingworld\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/twitch-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"ModernGamingWorld 的 Twitch 頻道\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/monumental-experience-in-the-sky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/curseforge_46h.png\" alt=\"宏偉體驗 - 天空之境\"></a></p>",
